safix::clan_address_unresolved

  × no machine in clan's own fleet resolves the mapping 'ntfy-token'.
  │ 
  │     placement   shared
  │     generator   ntfy
  │     file        token
  │ 
  │ The machine that addresses a shared var on clan's command line is
  │ discovered by asking clan which machines it has and trying each in turn,
  │ rather than declared, so there is no second field on the mapping to check
  │ against clan's own list.
  │ 
  │ Check the generator and file against what any machine in the fleet sees:
  │ 
  │     clan vars list <machine>
